<title>SINGAPORE: Asian rice prices - April 24.</title>
<headline>Asian rice prices - April 24.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rice prices quoted on Thursday by trading and official sources in the key Asian producing nations of Thailand, Vietnam, Pakistan and India in U.S. dollars a tonne:</p>
<p>							    April 24  April 17</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct white B benchmark FOB Bangkok 330-360   325-360</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct fragrant rice FOB Bangkok     680-695   660-695</p>
<p>India-5.0 pct broken(non-Basmati long grain)FOB  310	 310</p>
<p>India-10 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  290	 295</p>
<p>India-15 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  265	 260</p>
<p>India-25 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  245	 245</p>
<p>Vietnam-5.0 percent broken FOB Saigon port     225-230   230-235</p>
<p>Vietnam-10 percent broken FOB Saigon port	228-230   225-230</p>
<p>Pakistan-Basmati super FOB Pakistan port	 575-590   570-585</p>
<p>Pakistan-IRRI 6 FOB Pakistan port		  225-235   225-230</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703305)</p>
</text>
